HST Office: feature search of the ribbon tab row (sfx2::hst::ShowFeatureSearch).

The search box of the tab row (hst-ribbon-tab-search.patch, child id "hst-tab-search") includes
<notebookbar/HstFeatureSearch.hxx> when it exists and calls ShowFeatureSearch(box, typed text).

- sfx2/inc/notebookbar/HstFeatureSearch.hxx: the interface.
- sfx2/source/commandpopup/CommandPopup.cxx, sfx2/inc/commandpopup/CommandPopup.hxx,
  sfx2/source/view/viewfrm.cxx: the feature search popup (.uno:CommandPopup) opens under the box
  while the box is shown: from the box, from Shift+Esc and from Alt+Q; elsewhere where it opened
  before. A character typed into the box is the first text of the search. The last row,
  "Find “…” in the document" ("Tìm “…” trong tài liệu"), goes to the first match and opens
  Find & Replace with the text.
- include/sfx2/strings.hrc, translations/source/vi/sfx2/messages.po: STR_HST_FIND_IN_DOCUMENT.
- officecfg Accelerators.xcu: Alt+Q opens the feature search on Linux and Windows, as in Office;
  the key tips keep Q free on the tab level. Shift+Esc stays; macOS keeps Option+Cmd+K.
- sw, sc, sd notebookbar.ui: the "Tìm tính năng" button leaves the Home tab now that the tab row
  has the box; the "Trang đầu" menu keeps the item.

